### 3. Auction-Based Assignment
```python
class TaskAuction:
    def conduct_auction(self, task):
        # Broadcast task to all peers
        bids = self.broadcast_task_request(task)

        # Evaluate bids based on:
        evaluated_bids = []
        for bid in bids:
            score = self.evaluate_bid(bid, criteria={
